{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Story Synopsis \u25c6</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the year 3323, the revolutionary Meta Mirror Project emerged from the collaboration between humanity and the super AI &quot;Primus.&quot; This ambitious venture seeks to stabilize society and ensure security by repairing the consciousness of individuals struggling with intense emotional turmoil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey unfolds as Enforcer Decem, tasked with repairing bizarre Mirrormazes stemming from human minds. Navigate through these mazes, solve puzzles, and confront powerful Mirrormares.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following a mission that left Decem severely injured and devoid of memories, the path to rediscovery begins. As Decem relearns the abilities of an Enforcer, a gradual unveiling of the secrets surrounding the Meta Mirror Project ensues.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Innovative Spatial Retrace Mechanism \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/8da688aeea99596aef98fb7f354aec84.poster.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/8da688aeea99596aef98fb7f354aec84.webm?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/8da688aeea99596aef98fb7f354aec84.mp4?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the ability of &quot;Retrace&quot; to teleport back to previously visited locations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this power to outmaneuver foes, launch surprise attacks from blind spots, or devise clever solutions to complex puzzles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 A Diverse Array of Formidable Bosses \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/c929c722f3bcbb7484c005ecb24ca731.poster.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/c929c722f3bcbb7484c005ecb24ca731.webm?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/c929c722f3bcbb7484c005ecb24ca731.mp4?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a diverse array of formidable bosses born from human obsessions in Mirrormazes. Confront colossal mechs wreaking havoc, cunning foes obstructing your view, and shape-shifting entities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite their seeming invincibility, each boss harbors weaknesses waiting to be exploited. Analyze their tactics, use retrace and other skills to counter their attacks, and triumph over these imposing foes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Explore the Unique Art Style \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/576690298494cd285242cf2e6f23bc20.poster.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/576690298494cd285242cf2e6f23bc20.webm?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/576690298494cd285242cf2e6f23bc20.mp4?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a visually stunning world characterized by a soft, vibrant aesthetic. Traverse varied landscapes, from ancient ruins to bustling urban panoramas, ensuring a mesmerizing experience within the Mirrormazes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Customize play-style with Modules \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/e35e4715273ba326db0c7d858c5cce3c.poster.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/e35e4715273ba326db0c7d858c5cce3c.webm?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/e35e4715273ba326db0c7d858c5cce3c.mp4?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Primary Modules by defeating bosses and discover hidden Secondary Modules scattered across Mirrormazes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your play-style by choosing from 7 Primary Modules and their variations, focusing on counterattacks, raw power, or charged attacks, complemented by over 20 Secondary Modules. Craft your own distinct combat approach.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Shape the Fate of Your Companions \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/0e3208a8f9a3737b08abc0317eaf21a7.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as &quot;Enforcer Decem,&quot; residing alongside your allies on the Motherboard, venturing into Mirrormazes, and engaging in thoughtful exchanges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel multiple endings influenced by pivotal decisions made throughout the story.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You're Finally Awake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2179370/26013241ddb38af36282e2284ab3fe838cf51f22.jpg"},{"name":"Excuse Me?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2179370/9a5902ae8f018d47009d6339696d027f19969a45.jpg"},{"name":"The Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2179370/d081c3b9e1f5fae3b903424789b44c2cb747c830.jpg"},{"name":"The Enforcer with the X-Ray Eyes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2179370/b85a1f3440b4ac4aa61ba00a6a54bb6b057ac2cb.jpg"},{"name":"Wreck-It Decem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2179370/d7996cc00bbc90a8817641bf0d908c45c9d1a8ed.jpg"},{"name":"1/14","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2179370/e7e4d52a94dcca1bce60af6cf80ccc20962e0884.jpg"},{"name":"1/20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2179370/ba5d6837cdb3d0ed2ca0a81a95b3c088298f919b.jpg"},{"name":"In Learning You Will Teach","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2179370/451ba8ec34748a6f18a5c810941dd0254a6f4fc3.jpg"},{"name":"Rebel in the Rye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2179370/517111f5ddc3657fc30e56b92a6ab70fc15b9f4a.jpg"},{"name":"Gap Year","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2179370/907e36541e41b9861c88bee1aa54857fca5126fb.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2179370?t=1770892675","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/fb92fd8789115e1715f643deebc4d262413a