irrormares.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following a mission that left Decem severely injured and devoid of memories, the path to rediscovery begins. As Decem relearns the abilities of an Enforcer, a gradual unveiling of the secrets surrounding the Meta Mirror Project ensues.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Innovative Spatial Retrace Mechanism \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/8da688aeea99596aef98fb7f354aec84.poster.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/8da688aeea99596aef98fb7f354aec84.webm?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/8da688aeea99596aef98fb7f354aec84.mp4?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the ability of &quot;Retrace&quot; to teleport back to previously visited locations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this power to outmaneuver foes, launch surprise attacks from blind spots, or devise clever solutions to complex puzzles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 A Diverse Array of Formidable Bosses \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/c929c722f3bcbb7484c005ecb24ca731.poster.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/c929c722f3bcbb7484c005ecb24ca731.webm?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/c929c722f3bcbb7484c005ecb24ca731.mp4?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a diverse array of formidable bosses born from human obsessions in Mirrormazes. Confront colossal mechs wreaking havoc, cunning foes obstructing your view, and shape-shifting entities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite their seeming invincibility, each boss harbors weaknesses waiting to be exploited. Analyze their tactics, use retrace and other skills to counter their attacks, and triumph over these imposing foes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Explore the Unique Art Style \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/576690298494cd285242cf2e6f23bc20.poster.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/576690298494cd285242cf2e6f23bc20.webm?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/576690298494cd285242cf2e6f23bc20.mp4?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a visually stunning world characterized by a soft, vibrant aesthetic. Traverse varied landscapes, from ancient ruins to bustling urban panoramas, ensuring a mesmerizing experience within the Mirrormazes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Customize play-style with Modules \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/e35e4715273ba326db0c7d858c5cce3c.poster.avif?t=1770892675\" width